          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "فرصة — furṣa — \"a chance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كانت الرحلة فرصة جيدة للتعلم. kānat ar-riḥla furṣa jayyida li-t-taʿallum. The trip was a good chance to learn."
            },
