              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: فرص, furaṣ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "فرصة (furṣa) is built on the native Arabic root f-r-ṣ, \"a turn, an opportunity\" (Lane). A furṣa is one's turn, the right moment: a chance."
            }
          ]
        },
